      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters in any position triggers Free Games. \n-
      When Wild symbols from the Firecracker feature overlaps with Scatter, \n  the
      symbol will change to a Hybrid Wild that acts as both a Wild and Scatter.\n\n-
      Probability of Firecracker feature is increased during Free Games. \n- During
      Free Games, 3 or more Scatters in any position awards additional\n  Free Games.
      </size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=25><color=#00eaff>20 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_8
    value: "<size=18>Appears on reels \n2, 3, and 4.\n3 Bonuses pays \n<style=highlight
      1>2x</style> Total Bet. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_8
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>ZEUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>MULTIPLIER BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>LIGHTNING BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '<size=24>- With 4 or more consecutive wins in one spin, 4th win and onwards
      are doubled.

      - In Free Games, with 4+ wins, multiplier increases incrementally from 2x to
      10x.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "<size=24>- Occurs randomly during Base and Free games. \n- Zeus will turn
      at most 6 random symbols to Wild."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "<size=24>- Occurs randomly during Base and Free games. \n- 3 or more Scatters
      triggers 10 Free Games. \n- Free Games can be re-triggered. \n- Lightning Bonus
      is more likely to occur in Free Games.\n- Multiplier increases incrementally
      to at most 10x in Free Games."
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Kingdom of Zeus
